<Slide style={{
  width: '1280px',
  height: '720px',
  background: '#0A0F1E',
  padding: '40px 64px',
  flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
  <Text style={{
    fontSize: 34,
    fontWeight: 'bold',
    color: '#F8FAFC',
    marginBottom: 24,
    fontFamily: '"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif',
  }}>
    教师端 · 试卷管理与灵活组卷
  </Text>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'row',
    gap: 32,
    flex: 1,
    alignItems: 'stretch',
  }}>
    <Box style={{
      width: 440,
      background: '#131C33',
      borderRadius: 20,
      padding: 32,
      flexDirection: 'column',
      justifyContent: 'center',
      gap: 18,
      border: '1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.2)',
    }}>
      <Box style={{
        height: 80,
        background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A8A 0%, #2563EB 100%)',
        borderRadius: 12,
        justifyContent: 'center',
        alignItems: 'center',
      }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>题库</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#D4AF37', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>↓</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{
          flex: 1,
          height: 90,
          background: 'rgba(37,99,235,0.18)',
          borderRadius: 12,
          justifyContent: 'center',
          alignItems: 'center',
          border: '1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.4)',
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>原版真题</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
          flex: 1,
          height: 90,
          background: 'rgba(37,99,235,0.18)',
          borderRadius: 12,
          justifyContent: 'center',
          alignItems: 'center',
          border: '1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.4)',
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>教师自组卷</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#D4AF37', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>↓</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{
        height: 80,
        background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #D4AF37 0%, #F3D27A 100%)',
        borderRadius: 12,
        justifyContent: 'center',
        alignItems: 'center',
      }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0A0F1E' }}>审题 → 发布</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{
      flex: 1,
      flexDirection: 'column',
      justifyContent: 'center',
      gap: 18,
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C7D0E0', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        支持原版真题库与教师自定义组卷双轨管理；可按学科、套题类型、知识点筛选，从题库直接选题入卷。
      </Text>
      {[
        { title: '原版 / 组卷双轨', desc: '区分 OFFICIAL 与 CUSTOM，清晰管理' },
        { title: '多维筛选', desc: '学科 / 套题类型 / 名称排序 / 最新优先' },
        { title: '从题库选题', desc: '按知识点筛选，完整题干预览后入卷' },
        { title: '审题铁律', desc: '缺答案 / 缺解析题目禁止发布' },
      ].map((c, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{
          background: '#131C33',
          borderRadius: 14,
          padding: 18,
          flexDirection: 'row',
          alignItems: 'center',
          gap: 12,
          borderLeft: '3px solid #2563EB',
        }}>
          <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#2563EB', width: 22, height: 22 }} />
          <Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>{c.title}</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>{c.desc}</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'row',
    justifyContent: 'space-between',
    marginTop: 24,
  }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>金瑞升学 · 金鹰系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>15 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
